title Vinyl by touch: the output button opens the chooser, Esc goes back, the queue key opens the queue (480x320)
sizes 480x320
ppmm 608
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 800
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 300
shot t-output
expect text "Automatic"
tap "Esc"
wait 300
tapxy 0.89 0.87
wait 300
shot t-queue
expect text "Move up"
expect noquit
